 futuristische setting en biedt grote maps, voertuigen en verschillende specialisten met unieke vaardigheden.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"282\" data-end=\"291\"><strong data-start=\"282\" data-end=\"291\">Staat</strong></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"293\" data-end=\"307\">In Nette Staat</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"309\" data-end=\"320\">⭐ Voordelen</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"322\" data-end=\"505\">• Grootschalige multiplayer gevechten<br data-start=\"359\" data-end=\"362\">• Grote maps met voertuigen en teamplay<br data-start=\"401\" data-end=\"404\">• Verschillende specialisten met unieke vaardigheden<br data-start=\"456\" data-end=\"459\">• Dynamische en futuristische oorlogssetting</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"507\" data-end=\"523\">📋 Specificaties</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"525\" data-end=\"712\"><strong data-start=\"525\" data-end=\"538\">Platform:</strong> PlayStation 4<br data-start=\"552\" data-end=\"555\"><strong data-start=\"555\" data-end=\"565\">Titel:</strong> Battlefield 2042<br data-start=\"582\" data-end=\"585\"><strong data-start=\"585\" data-end=\"595\">Genre:</strong> Shooter / Action<br data-start=\"612\" data-end=\"615\"><strong data-start=\"615\" data-end=\"629\">Spelmodus:</strong> Multiplayer / Online<br data-start=\"650\" data-end=\"653\"><strong data-start=\"653\" data-end=\"666\">Uitgever:</strong> Electronic Arts<br data-start=\"682\" data-end=\"685\"><strong data-start=\"685\" data-end=\"695\">Staat:</strong> In Nette Staat</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"714\" data-end=\"728\">📦 Meegeleverd</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"730\" data-end=\"758\">Game disc<br data-start=\"739\" data-end=\"742\">Origineel doosje</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"760\" data-end=\"778\">🛡️ Incl. Garantie</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"780\" data-end=\"812\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Incl. Garantie: 1 maand garantie</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\"> </div>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"text-center\"> </div>\r\n</